### 1. CREATE EMPLOYEE (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rahul",
  "lastName": "Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "department": "IT",
  "designation": "Software Tester",
  "joiningDate": "2026-11-10",
  "onboardingStatus": "PENDING"
}
### Get all employees
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees


### 4. UPDATE EMPLOYEE
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rahul",
  "lastName": "Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "9999999999",
  "department": "Quality Assurance",
  "designation": "QA Tester",
  "joiningDate": "2026-11-10",
  "onboardingStatus": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
### DELETE EMPLOYEE
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/employees/3


### 5. CREATE FIVE ONBOARDING STEPS FOR EMPLOYEE 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/3/steps

### 6. GET ALL ONBOARDING STEPS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/3/steps

### 7. COMPLETE FIRST ONBOARDING STEP
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/steps/1?status=COMPLETED


### CREATE THREE CHECKLIST ITEMS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checklist/3

### GET CHECKLIST
GET http://localhost:8080/api/checklist/3
